    <briefdescription>
<para>This implementation of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_loop_safety_info" kindref="compound">LoopSafetyInfo</ref> use <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_implicit_control_flow_tracking" kindref="compound">ImplicitControlFlowTracking</ref> to give precise answers on &quot;may throw&quot; queries. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This implementation uses cache that should be invalidated by calling the methods insertInstructionTo and removeInstruction whenever we modify a basic block&apos;s contents by adding or removing instructions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
